  "repo_truth": "Closure run p2-evidence-evaluator-planning-closure-1 closed discovery findings P2-2 and P2-4 through P2-7, but returned two causal P2 findings. The parent added an eighth closed transaction schema, safely bounded enumeration of a unique maximal immutable transaction chain, exact binding from that tip to both mutable heads and the current record, simultaneous-head rollback proof, and ordered closed dependency observations binding exact retained bytes/errors for every dependency class. Production/test bytes remain unchanged at 00dde01. P2 runtime, P4's separate negative-surface proof, P6, Phase 2 exit, and HCM-3.x remain closed.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of the complete 23-entry post-supplemental manifest and comparison with closure subject 0b10551c.",
    "Delta-focused closure of exactly p2-evidence-evaluator-planning-closure-1-P2-1 and P2-2.",
    "Verify the unique maximal immutable transaction selector detects simultaneous mutable-head rollback while newer transactions remain.",
    "Verify ordered dependency observations bind every attempted dependency's exact retained bytes or exact no-byte failure into the closure fingerprint.",
    "Report a directly caused or unmasked P1/P2 inside those two remediations; no open-ended discovery."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No approval or implementation of P2 runtime/schema/definition/native adapter/Environment Context or P6.",
    "No reopening the five discovery findings already closed by the preceding reviewer absent a demonstrated remediation-caused P1/P2.",
    "No P4 negative-surface work and no unrelated .claude, AGENTS.md, or CLAUDE.md paths."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify manifest and post-remediation aggregate identity.",
    "Confirm P2-1 closure: exact immutable transaction schema/ref/preimage, strict bounded directory enumeration, unique maximal chain, head/record/use-head equality, journal receipt ordering/recovery, and simultaneous-head rollback/fork/gap/cycle proofs.",
    "Confirm P2-2 closure: exact dependency-kind enum/order/row fields/nullability/error grammar and binding for head, transactions, records, sources, definitions, identity, registry, credential, use head, challenge, response, assertion, and transition.",
    "Check coupled 04/SPEC/plan/todo/P7 status and eight-schema/P2S/P2P/P2R selectors agree without runtime promotion.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "Planning/documentation only; no runtime authorization",
    "Unique maximal immutable transaction tip is the live-store rollback selector and both mutable heads must match it",
    "Every attempted dependency observation binds exact retained raw bytes or exact no-byte failure",
    "Full external snapshot rollback with deletion of all newer immutable transactions is explicitly outside claimed local proof",
    "Released definitions/fingerprints and production/test bytes remain unchanged",
    "P2A still requires non-production feasibility and a second human production-adapter decision",
    "P4 negative-surface proof and P6 remain open/forbidden"
